---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeading from '../components/PageHeading.astro';
import profile from '../data/profile.json';
---

<Layout
  title="About Sidartha Kumar | Development, SEO & Testing"
  description="Meet Sidartha Kumar: a development background spanning websites, SEO, and testing, with a current focus on full-stack applications and AI automation."
>
  <PageHeading
    eyebrow="ABOUT / SIDARTHA KUMAR"
    title="Experience behind me. Curiosity ahead."
  />
  <section class="container about-layout">
    <aside class="about-aside">
      <span class="about-initials" aria-hidden="true">
        sk<span>.</span>
      </span>
      <p class="eyebrow">THE THREAD THROUGH THE WORK</p>
      <h2>
        Make technology
        <br />
        useful.
      </h2>
      <p>Development, discovery, and the details that make things work.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href={profile.github}>
        Find me on GitHub ↗
      </a>
    </aside>
    <div class="prose">
      <h2>Hi, I’m Sidartha.</h2>
      <p>{profile.introduction}</p>
      <p>
        My earlier work began in 2009. Over time, it has included WordPress
        sites, business websites, online stores, frontend pages, backend
        systems, and scripts, alongside work in search visibility and paid
        advertising.
      </p>
      <p>
        I bring approximately five to six years of development experience, at
        least four years in SEO, and around six months in testing.
      </p>
      <h2>What I’m focused on now</h2>
      <p>
        Full-stack applications and APIs are my main development direction. I’m
        also exploring Python, AI tools, and automation: understanding the
        problem first, then finding where the technology can help.
      </p>
      <p>
        I’m continuing to learn across React, Node.js, JavaScript, databases,
        and testing tools. My <a href="/skills/">skills page</a> makes that
        current learning visible alongside my background.
      </p>
      <h2>How I approach the work</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Understand the problem and the people using the solution.</li>
        <li>Build something useful, then improve it with evidence.</li>
        <li>Consider usability, search visibility, and testing together.</li>
        <li>Keep decisions and maintenance understandable.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>What comes next</h2>
      <p>
        I’m interested in employment opportunities and freelance projects
        aligned with my experience and direction. If you have a role, website,
        application, or a clearly scoped problem to discuss,{' '}
        <a href="/contact/">let’s talk</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
